From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t3code-customize <t3code-customize@localhost>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 17:53:16 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] fix(tests): honor Windows filesystem modes

Windows reports read/write bits for every class, so the owner-only mode checks expect 0o666 there and 0o600 on POSIX.

Claude Code keeps settings.local.json in cwd on Windows, so the tool search test, which asserts the repository-root lookup, now runs as a POSIX host.

The attachment tests look for file paths inside JSON.stringify output, which escapes Windows backslashes, so they now match the JSON-encoded path.
---
 .../Adapters/ClaudeAdapterV2.test.ts              | 15 ++++++++++-----
 .../src/provider/claudeResetCredits.test.ts       | 10 +++++++---
 2 files changed, 17 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

